       CALL-ZCU06319-001.
               CALL 'ZCU06319' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZCU06319 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
